<title>SWITZERLAND: Schindler gets order for Athens airport.</title>
<headline>Schindler gets order for Athens airport.</headline>
<dateline>EBIKON, Switzerland 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schindler AG said it had received a 12 million Swiss franc order to install escalators and moving sidewalks at the new airport in Athens.</p>
<p>It also got an order worth five million francs for lifts and escalators for the expanded international terminal at Rome's airport.</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
